e in Bangladesh. Efficient, reliable, and built with high-quality components for gaming and productivity rigs.</h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The DeepCool PK650D is a 650 W non-modular&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/component/power-supply\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">power supply</a> designed for stable and efficient performance in gaming and productivity PCs. With 80 PLUS Bronze certification, it delivers up to 85% efficiency, minimizing wasted energy and heat. Its DC-to-DC conversion architecture ensures tight voltage regulation for +3.3V and +5V rails, making it ideal for modern hardware. A quiet 120 mm Hypro-bearing fan keeps the unit cool under load, while a full suite of protection features—including OVP, OCP, OPP, SCP, UVP, and OTP—safeguards your system. Built with high-quality capacitors, this PSU provides reliable power over the long term, and its compact ATX form factor ensures compatibility with a wide range of PC cases. Backed by a 5-year warranty, the PK650D offers a solid combination of performance, reliability, and value.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"DeepCool PL550D 550 Watt Non-Modular 80 Plus Bronze ATX 3.0 Power Supply","href":"/deepcool-pl550d-550-watt-non-modular-80-plus-bronze-atx-30-power-supply","now":"5,900৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"DeepCool PN750D 750W 80 Plus Gold Non-Modular ATX 3.1 Power Supply","href":"/deepcool-pn750d-750w-80-plus-gold-non-modular-atx-31-power-supply","now":"9,500৳","old":"9,800৳","single":""},{"name":"DeepCool PN650D 650W 80 Plus Gold Non-Modular ATX 3.1 Power Supply","href":"/deepcool-pn650d-650w-80-plus-gold-non-modular-atx-31-power-supply","now":"8,250৳","old":"8,800৳","single":""},{"name":"Corsair CV550 550 Watt 80 Plus Bronze Certified Non-Modular ATX Power Supply","href":"/corsair-cv550-550-watt-80-plus-bronze-certified-non-modular-atx-power-su